{"version": 2, "width": 80, "height": 24, "timestamp": 1767911739, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "Property Validator / propval - Tuulbelt"}
[0.005038, "o", "# Property Validator v0.10.0 Demo\r\n"]
[1.007165, "o", "\r\n# 1. Install globally for easy access\r\n"]
[1.508686, "o", "$ npm link\r\n"]
[2.510127, "o", "\r\n# 2. Validate valid user data\r\n"]
[3.011432, "o", "$ cat demo-files/valid-user.json\r\n"]
[3.012565, "o", "{\r\n  \"name\": \"Alice\",\r\n  \"age\": 30,\r\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\"\r\n}\r\n"]
[4.013879, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.013966, "o", "$ propval \"$(cat demo-files/valid-user.json)\"\r\n"]
[5.145878, "o", "{\r\n  \"name\": \"Alice\",\r\n  \"age\": 30,\r\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\"\r\n}\r\n"]
[7.167169, "o", "\r\n# 3. Validate invalid data (clear error message)\r\n"]
[7.668732, "o", "$ cat demo-files/invalid-user.json\r\n"]
[7.669686, "o", "{\r\n  \"name\": \"Bob\",\r\n  \"age\": \"thirty\",\r\n  \"email\": \"bob@example.com\"\r\n}\r\n"]
[8.671057, "o", "\r\n$ propval \"$(cat demo-files/invalid-user.json)\"\r\n"]
[9.713341, "o", "Validation error: Invalid property 'age': Expected number, got string\r\n"]
[11.733065, "o", "\r\n# 4. Fast check mode (boolean output)\r\n"]
[12.234514, "o", "$ propval --check '{\"name\":\"Alice\",\"age\":30,\"email\":\"alice@example.com\"}' && echo \"Valid!\"\r\n"]
[13.287606, "o", "Valid!\r\n"]
[15.288958, "o", "\r\n# 5. View available API\r\n"]
[15.790373, "o", "$ propval --api | head -20\r\n"]
[16.829182, "o", "\r\nProperty Validator v0.10.0 - API Reference\r\n\r\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n Validation Functions\r\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n  validate(schema, data)     Full validation with error details\r\n  check(schema, data)        Boolean-only (faster, no errors)\r\n  compileCheck(schema)       Pre-compiled boolean validator\r\n\r\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n String Validators\r\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n  v.string()                 Base string validator\r\n"]
[16.829309, "o", "    .min(n)                  Minimum length\r\n    .max(n)                  Maximum length\r\n    .length(n)               Exact length\r\n    .nonempty()              Non-empty string\r\n    .pattern(regex, msg?)    Custom regex pattern\r\n    .startsWith(prefix)      String prefix\r\n"]
[18.849039, "o", "\r\n# Runtime type validation for JavaScript/TypeScript\r\n"]
[18.84915, "o", "# New in v0.10.0: record(), discriminatedUnion(), toJsonSchema()\r\n"]
